# The production picker's right-click menu: a right click marks the cell under the mouse and opens a menu there ("Set production", "Add
# to queue", "Obsolete" for a design that may be hidden, "Cancel all obsolete", "Help"). Obsolete hides the design (a bit in its prototype,
# which is state compared) and the list is made again without it; Cancel all obsolete brings the hidden designs back. See
# prodpicker.scene for how it is opened. Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
# The leaders' portraits in the base screen animate on their own slow clock.
mask 266 625 310 678
mask 702 624 760 680
25 load
48 click 362 734         # the note's Close
55 key b                 # found a base where the colony pod stands
64 key Return            # its base screen
68 state pp_sel 0x6b27b8 12
68 state pp_grid 0x6b2854 32
72 click 175 723         # CHANGE
76 move 600 420
80 snap open
82 rclick 240 120        # the Scout Patrol: marked, and the menu opens
88 snap menu
90 click 279 170         # Obsolete
98 snap obsolete         # the Scout Patrol is gone from the list
100 rclick 240 120       # the Colony Pod is the first now
106 snap menu-again
108 click 310 189        # Cancel all obsolete
116 snap restored
118 rclick 510 120       # a facility: no Obsolete in its menu
124 snap menu-facility
126 click 310 170        # Cancel all obsolete (the third line now)
134 snap restored-again
136 click 664 515        # CANCEL
144 close
